    "scenesThatPass": [
      "YOUNG CATHERINE: Babies.\nYOUNG ANITA: Whatcha readin'?\nYOUNG ANITA: Sorry to scare you.\nYOUNG ANITA: Saw you sitting alone and wanted ta say hello. So -- \"Hello!\"",
      "YOUNG CATHERINE: GRIEF! It's a word for when someone causes you pain.\nYOUNG ANITA: Like when a bloke rubs the back of your neck and smiles through the moustache. If you pee your pants when that happens - that's grief.\nYOUNG ANITA: 'Bout right, don't cha think?\nYOUNG ANITA: Wanna swing on swings?",
      "YOUNG CATHERINE: If those things are happening, my parents will take you in. I'll force them to.\nYOUNG CATHERINE: Anita -- you need to stay somewhere else.\nYOUNG ANITA: How do you know?\nYOUNG CATHERINE: Because I read books on therapy!",
      "ANITA: You need help.\nCATHERINE: I'm not calling the police! Are you fucking crazy?\nANITA: Crime of passion --\nCATHERINE: 'Crime of passion' my arse! -- Call the police --",
      "ANITA: Uh -- Do I need to be here for this?\nCATHERINE: For a girl who loves Goosebumps, you sure are queasy darling.\nANITA: You'd better double bag it."
    ]
  },
